• AddApiVersioning: Configures API versioning services, including options for default version,
version reporting, and version readers.
• [ApiVersion] Attribute: Specifies the supported versions for a controller or action method.
• Routes: Define versioned routes to access different API versions.
• Version Readers: Methods to extract version information from request headers, URLs, or
query strings.

